度，再者湯頭可以吃出老闆用心燉煮，甜而不膩 在味道上取得一個非常好的平衡，並不會感受到某些調味特別強烈而蓋過去雞白湯原有的精隨。\n最後再提一點 店家可以為客人客製化麵條的熟度，真的不得不說吃了這麼多間拉麵店，這算是少數店家會主動提及問我麵條想要煮幾秒，憑這點上服務態度跟用心真的是毋須多言了。\n\n開店不容易，開一家優質的拉麵店更不容易，這種店家有機會還會再度光臨的!\n\nP.S 店家自製的\"蒜酥\"真的好香，在高湯裡頭撒上一些些 喝下去真的是一種享受啊~",null,[0,106]]]],[null,1678441288000000,1678441288000000,"3 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQUFWS2FCNER0OHRrY1NaNUFBQVBJQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQUFWS2FCNER0OHRrY1NaNUFBQVBJQRoTQ2d3SXlQYXJvQVlRd0tYOTRRRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiU1_-Dx9KWAxUGl68BHTfXFcsQ_2MIrwEoBw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3212438097275943845/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hbkI1ZGtkUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3212438097275943845/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hbkI1ZGtkUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3212438097275943845/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hbkI1ZGtkUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3212438097275943845/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hbkI1ZGtkUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3212438097275943845/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hbkI1ZGtkUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3212438097275943845/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUm9hbkI1ZGtkUkVBRRAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝您這麼細心地品嚐以及對我們熱情的讚賞。這是對我們最大的肯定，也歡迎你們常常來吃黃金拉麵喔！❤️❤️❤️",null,[0,53]]]],[null,null,5330,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoanB5dkdREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x47f68a7b1c241a4c!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDhjpyvGQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoanB5dkdREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoanB5dkdREi0KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRGhqcHl2bVFFEhJDZ3NJalktam9BWVE0S