ll,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwiU1_-Dx9KWAxUGl68BHTfXFcsQ3IcHCMMBKAk",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwiU1_-Dx9KWAxUGl68BHTfXFcsQ3IcHCMQBKAo",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwiU1_-Dx9KWAxUGl68BHTfXFcsQ3IcHCMUBKAs",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["🍜雞白湯玫瑰鹽/味噌-標準嘟嘟好 NT$220\n贈送的醃蘿蔔與糖心蛋不錯吃，用大量雞骨，整隻台東土雞🐔，純雞加上新鮮蔬菜熬製，湯頭不是特別濃，算是比較清透順口，整體配料份量足夠，提供加的湯不是加熱清水而是清雞湯還不錯鮮甜，店內提供熱養生茶的味道有點像紅棗茶很適合天冷喝，調味料有七味粉與我很喜歡的蒜酥，服務部分有提供酒精濕紙巾，整體會覺得店家很貼心。\n\n因為我本身愛喝湯，加上店家的湯頭不是濃的類型比較不會喝膩，所以湯不夠多就不是很過癮，雖然可加一球麵與加湯，但還是比較希望原本湯再多一些，如果湯再多一些會比較讓我回頭，畢竟價錢的部分在這個區域算是稍微高一點點的，而同價錢外面選擇也很競爭，能讓人感到滿足很重要。\n\n以上純屬個人小小意見\n\n🍜Chicken broth with rose salt/miso - Standard NT$220\nThe pickled daikon and sugar heart egg that came with it were delicious. They used a lot of chicken bones and a whole Taitung chicken🐔 to make the soup, which was clear and mild. The overall amount of ingredients was sufficient, and they provided soup that was not just heated water but clear chicken soup, which was fresh and sweet. The taste of the hot health tea provided in the shop was a bit like red date tea and suitable for drinking in cold weather. Seasonings included seven-spice powder and my favorite garlic crisps. The service also provided alcohol wipes, which made me feel that the shop was thoughtful.\n\nAs I love soup, and the soup is not the type that gets too heavy, I find that it's not quite satisfying when there isn't enough soup. Although you can add a ball of noodles and soup, I still wish there were more soup to begin with. If there was more soup, it would make me more likely to come back. After all, the price is slightly higher in this area, and there's a lot of competition outside that offers similar prices. It's important to feel satisfied.\n\nThe above is purely my personal opinion.",null,[0,175]]]],[null,1673194829000000,1673194829